    "title": "2 Cleveland State police officers released from hospital after being injured while making arrest - NewsBreak",
    "text": "8 hours ago CLEVELAND — Cleveland State University says two of its police officers were injured while making an arrest Wednesday. According to a school spokesperson, the two officers encountered \"a person engaged in criminal activity\" at the Subway on the corner of East 18th Street and Euclid Avenue, not far from Playhouse Square. The pair were hurt \"while apprehending the individual.\" Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
